msgid "I was at Orsha and heard the guns roar. What I write below I heard from my grandfather, and he from his father. What is true here and what is a tale, judge for yourselves."
msgstr "I was at Orsha and heard the guns roar. What I write below I heard from my grandfather, and he from his father. What is true here and what is a tale, judge for yourselves."

msgid "In August Master Ulrich declared war on King Jogaila and marched on Dobrzyń. In autumn they made a truce until Midsummer Day. All winter both sides forged spears. And our great-grandfather rode beyond the Neman for the first time in his life."
msgstr "In August Master Ulrich declared war on King Jogaila and marched on Dobrzyń. In autumn they made a truce until Midsummer Day. All winter both sides forged spears. And our great-grandfather rode beyond the Neman for the first time in his life."

